m sin far. Men Karl-Bertils hjälte är Robin Hood. Den fattiga flickan Vera, hennes syster på barnhemmet och den hänsynslösa barnhemsföreståndaren korsar alla Karl-Bertils väg. Och ingen är sig lik när historien når sitt slut. Inte ens Tyko.","tagline":"Vissa sagor förtjänar att bli verklighet"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v5TYhMmCzVqsZ66mBI6SVKMLBYG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v5TYhMmCzVqsZ66mBI6SVKMLBYG.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/105kVP54fB2mxIdtirFUML4I9xF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/105kVP54fB2mxIdtirFUML4I9xF.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eAWP4Ap4FOkAazK4CZuMcJxEm3t.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eAWP4Ap4FOkAazK4CZuMcJxEm3t.jpg","language":"en","width":1792,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6TWtdgDfxxeq13cAnmOKotYtmVe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6TWtdgDfxxeq13cAnmOKotYtmVe.jpg","language":"sv","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a4UEt3NEYIZG87T9UjwDrKJT26D.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a4UEt3NEYIZG87T9UjwDrKJT26D.jpg","language":"sv","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mrv61npArFQe3QM6tovADOBTeOn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mrv61npArFQe3QM6tovADOBTeOn.jpg","language":"sv","width":1650,"height":2475},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9HYZ0j2wSr8la9dbiWuCGdX5Eba.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9HYZ0j2wSr8la9dbiWuCGdX5Eba.jpg","language":"sv","width":2000,"height":3000}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hDX5M8sPo9ELQXKkqzoCLGN6z1S.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hDX5